  "releaseNotes": "Adds translation package validation, including glossary, reference terminology, consistency, and XLIFF character-limit checks.\n      Translation preparation now exports terminology and file-style metadata, supports expected BC versions, and preserves existing target file conventions.\n      CHANGELOG.md contains the complete details.",
